The data came from RHIC Run II in year 2001. Not all the runs were analyzed. We referred to the run log to see which runs contain good data. For this analysis, the following run numbers were selected: 2329088, 2329089, 2329091, 2329092, 2329093, 2329094, 2329100, 2329101, 2330002, 2330003, 2330003, 2330004, and 2330005 3.

