\[\frac{dN_{\rm ch}}{d\eta}\frac{1}{0.5\langle N_{\rm part}\rangle}=1.96\pm 0.03({\rm stat.})\pm 0.16({\rm syst.}) \tag{6.27}\]

where \(N_{\rm part}\) is the number of participants from the optical Glauber model calculation (Appendix E and [181]).

