\[\langle\beta_{T}\rangle = \frac{\int_{0}^{R}d^{2}r\,\beta_{T}}{\int_{0}^{R}d^{2}r} \tag{6.38}\] \[\mbox{(in this model, $r$ lies in a 2-d plane)}\] \[= \frac{\int_{0}^{2\pi}\!\!\int_{0}^{R}dr\,r\,d\phi\beta_{s}(r/R)^{ n}}{\int_{0}^{2\pi}\!\!\int_{0}^{R}dr\,r\,d\phi}\] \[= \frac{\beta_{s}}{R^{n}}\,\frac{\int_{0}^{R}dr\,r^{n+1}}{\int_{0} ^{R}dr\,r}\] \[= \frac{\beta_{s}}{R^{n}}\,\frac{R^{n+2}/(n+2)}{R^{2}/2}=\frac{2 \beta_{s}}{n+2}\]

